      "alt": "tqmls1028a board",
      "text": "<h1>Based on LS1028A with 4 Port TSN Gigabit Ethernet Switch for Real-time demands.</h1>\r\n<p>The TQMLS1028A is an embedded module powered by the Cortex-A72 processor LS1028A from NXP, combining high-performance Arm architecture with QorIQ communication technology. It offers a 4 Port TSN Gigabit Ethernet Switch, making it ideal for real-time applications. This module supports extended temperature ranges, ensuring reliability in challenging environments. With a low power consumption profile, it's energy-efficient for embedded applications. Security functions are integrated to protect sensitive data.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:51:18 GMT+0000",
      "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
